  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker with ice; add pineapple juice, melon liqueur, and rum. Cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted. Strain into a chilled rocks glass. Pour in raspberry liqueur and let it sink to the bottom, then carefully pour Jägermeister on top.",
